                "title": "Pantera leads $20 million raise for OpenMind\u2019s decentralized operating system for robots",
                "text": "\n            <p>Venture firms are backing OpenMind, a startup building a decentralized operating system for robots, founded by a Stanford professor.</p>\n        ",
